{"id":"99aa8943f30c6e5e","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-system-f-normalization.md","title":"System F Normalization","display":"thm-system-f-normalization — System F Normalization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-system-f-normalization","aliases":["72-thm-system-f-normalization"],"display":"thm-system-f-normalization — System F Normalization","depends_on":["[[72-df-system-f]]","[[72-df-normalization-proof]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, ch.14 §§14.1–14.3 print115–125","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","proof_status":"source theorem statement checked; full proof not reproduced or machine verified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-system-f-normalization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-system-f-normalization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-system-f-normalization — System F Normalization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a59aab1599221f4a\" href=\"?note=a59aab1599221f4a\" title=\"72-df-system-f\">72-df-system-f</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db757aa1a8cf57f3\" href=\"?note=db757aa1a8cf57f3\" title=\"72-df-normalization-proof\">72-df-normalization-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, ch.14 §§14.1–14.3 print115–125"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source theorem statement checked; full proof not reproduced or machine verified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-system-f-normalization\">thm-system-f-normalization</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{F}M:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{F}M:A\\)</span>、合法项集与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_F\">\\(\\beta_F\\)</span> 取自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a59aab1599221f4a\" href=\"?note=a59aab1599221f4a\" title=\"72-df-system-f\">72-df-system-f</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SN}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{SN}_R\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Normal}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Normal}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"db757aa1a8cf57f3\" href=\"?note=db757aa1a8cf57f3\" title=\"72-df-normalization-proof\">72-df-normalization-proof</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{F}M:A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{SN}_{\\beta_F}(M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{F}M:A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{SN}_{\\beta_F}(M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{F}M:A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists N\\ (\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in \\beta_F^*\\land\\operatorname{Normal}_{\\beta_F}(N)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{F}M:A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists N\\ (\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in \\beta_F^*\\land\\operatorname{Normal}_{\\beta_F}(N)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>强正规化结论针对所有兼容β归约序列；存在正规形是推论，不能取代强正规化。System F同时含项β与类型β。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-system-f-normalization","text":"thm-system-f-normalization","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-system-f","status":"resolved","id":"a59aab1599221f4a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-system-f]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-normalization-proof","status":"resolved","id":"db757aa1a8cf57f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-normalization-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-system-f","status":"resolved","id":"a59aab1599221f4a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash_{F}M:A$、合法项集与 $\\beta_F$ 取自 [[72-df-system-f]]。$\\operatorname{SN}_R$ 与 $\\operatorname{Normal}_R$ 见 [[72-df-normalization-proof]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-normalization-proof","status":"resolved","id":"db757aa1a8cf57f3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash_{F}M:A$、合法项集与 $\\beta_F$ 取自 [[72-df-system-f]]。$\\operatorname{SN}_R$ 与 $\\operatorname{Normal}_R$ 见 [[72-df-normalization-proof]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_{F}M:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SN}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Normal}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_{F}M:A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{SN}_{\\beta_F}(M).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_{F}M:A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists N\\ (\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in \\beta_F^*\\land\\operatorname{Normal}_{\\beta_F}(N)).","display":true}],"bytes":1344,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-300","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-system-f-normalization|thm-system-f-normalization — System F Normalization]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-300","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-system-f-normalization|thm-system-f-normalization — System F Normalization]]"}],"outgoing":["a59aab1599221f4a","db757aa1a8cf57f3"]}